{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highland Keep is a third-person survival strategy set in the dark, mist-covered medieval Scotland. As a clan leader, you will engage in base building, colony management, survival mechanics, and real-time action combat in an open world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total Freedom of Castle Building<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/a4238f4e0cede5b802c48277f64cdd3e.poster.avif?t=1772265919\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/a4238f4e0cede5b802c48277f64cdd3e.webm?t=1772265919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build any castle you want, without presets or limits. Construct walls, towers, interiors, traps, crafting stations, storage rooms, and smaller structures piece by piece. Every keep is unique, functional, and fully explorable your fortress reflects your strategy and your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fully Simulated Living World </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/bc9e2cc296909780d1c71cf72d89b1f4.poster.avif?t=1772265919\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/bc9e2cc296909780d1c71cf72d89b1f4.webm?t=1772265919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world runs in real time, even when you are not directly involved. Other clans exist, expand, fight, trade, and raid on their own. Choose diplomacy, alliances, trade, or total war. Your decisions shape regional power, borders, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character-Driven Progression<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/d690205a48bb62b2b57fd3e30bcd4bca.poster.avif?t=1772265919\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/d690205a48bb62b2b57fd3e30bcd4bca.webm?t=1772265919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character development directly affects gameplay systems unlocking advanced building options, improving clan management, influencing morale, and enhancing combat abilities. How you grow your character defines how your settlement and clan evolve. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3107870?t=1772265919","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772265919","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/98cb868951b2ddd9190949543ae91b26acead52b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772265919","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/98cb868951b2ddd9190949543ae91b26acead52b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772265919","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Our game primarily contains violence, including scenes with blood and combat-related injuries. While the game does not depict explicit sexual content, players should be aware that it involves intense and graphic depictions of medieval combat, which may be disturbing to some"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highland Keep is a third-person survival strategy set in the dark, mist-covered medieval Scotland. As a clan leader, you will engage in base building, colony management, survival mechanics, and real-time action combat in an open world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total Freedom of Castle Building<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/a4238f4e0cede5b802c48277f64cdd3e.poster.avif?t=1772265919\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/a4238f4e0cede5b802c48277f64cdd3e.webm?t=1772265919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build any castle you want, without presets or limits. Construct walls, towers, interiors, traps, crafting stations, storage rooms, and smaller structures piece by piece. Every keep is unique, functional, and fully explorable your fortress reflects your strategy and your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fully Simulated Living World </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/bc9e2cc296909780d1c71cf72d89b1f4.poster.avif?t=1772265919\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107870/extras/bc9e2cc296909780d1c71cf72d89b1f4.webm?t=1772265919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world runs in real time, even when you are not directly involved. Other clans exist, expand, fight, trade, and raid on their own. Choose diplomacy, alliances, trade, or total war. Your decisions shape regional power, borders, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character-Driven Progression<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_